1. DEFINITIONS

"Software" means TvennDB Free as distributed by Hubbiot AB: its container
images, binaries and Helm chart, with the Free Features listed in Schedule A.

"Enterprise Features" means the features listed in Schedule B and any other
feature that Hubbiot AB offers only under a commercial licence.

"Supporting Materials" means the examples, compose files and Helm values that
Hubbiot AB publishes for use with the Software.

"Affiliate" means an entity that controls You, that You control, or that is
under common control with You. "Control" means owning more than 50 percent of
the votes or having the right to direct the entity's management.

"Production Use" means running the Software to store or serve data that any
business activity, product, service or operation relies on, including internal
operations.

"Non-Production Use" means evaluation, development, testing, continuous
integration, training and demonstration, and proofs of concept that no business
activity, product, service or operation relies on.

"Small Company" means an organisation that, counted together with all its
Affiliates, has both:
  (a) fewer than 50 people working as employees and independent contractors;
      and
  (b) less than EUR 10 000 000 in total revenue in its most recently
      completed financial year.

"Non-Commercial Organisation" means a registered charity, a non-profit
organisation, an educational institution or a public research organisation,
when using the Software for its non-commercial activities. Government bodies
and companies owned by them are not Non-Commercial Organisations.


