SCHEDULE A: FREE FEATURES

  - GQL, the ontology registry, property indexes and named graphs
  - Vector and full text search inside GQL
  - History, time travel, diff and dated imports
  - Sharding, Raft replication and transactions across shards, including adding
    shard groups for new partitions
  - Backup and restore to a directory or S3 compatible storage
  - Users, services, API keys and roles per graph
  - Membranes: labels a principal cannot see, subtrees it is confined to
  - MCP endpoint, events and webhooks, import and export
  - The Explorer, the Helm chart and Prometheus metrics


SCHEDULE B: ENTERPRISE FEATURES (NOT INCLUDED)

  - Single sign on
  - The audit log
  - Usage reports
  - Rate and size limits per principal or key
  - Online rebalancing and partition moves


